    intro: `Buy one get one deals, commonly known as BOGO deals, are among the most popular and valuable promotions in the cannabis dispensary space, effectively giving you two products for the price of one or close to it. BOGO deals come in several variations: BOGO free means you buy one item at full price and get a second identical or similar item completely free, BOGO 50% off means the second item is half price, and BOGO penny deals let you pick up the second item for just one cent. Some dispensaries also offer creative variations like buy two get one free or buy one get one of a different product category free. These deals are most commonly found on products that dispensaries want to promote, including new product launches, overstocked items, or house brands that the dispensary manufactures in-house. Flower, pre-rolls, and edibles are the most frequently featured product categories in BOGO promotions, though you can find BOGO deals on virtually any product type. To maximize the value of BOGO deals, focus on products you already know you enjoy and will consume within a reasonable timeframe — buying two of something you end up not liking is not a good deal at any price. Pay attention to whether the BOGO applies to identical items only or if you can mix and match between strains, flavors, or even product types. Check the fine print for restrictions on the free or discounted item, as some deals require the second item to be of equal or lesser value. BOGO deals are especially common during holiday shopping periods like 4/20, Green Wednesday, and Black Friday, when dispensaries compete aggressively for customers with their most generous promotions of the year.`,
